      "side": 1,
      "message": "With https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/3179242/1,\nI\u0027ve requested to add a vendor hook in madvise_cold_or_pageout_pte_range() to abort pageout process at mm-\u003emmap_lock contended.\nI also want to notify userspace this abort to let the user try this later or else.\nFirstly, madvise_pageout() always returns 0, except !can_madv_lru_vma().\nSo we can not abort immediately.\nSecond, even if it has got aborted by some condition, process_madvise will return any size of vma processed by iteration.\nThis vendor hook lets madvise to return error value on abort condition.",
